Package: gcamLearn
Title: Endogenous Technology Learning-by-Doing for GCAM via gcamwrapper
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Huilin", "", , "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for running GCAM (via 'gcamwrapper') with endogenous
    technology learning-by-doing cost updates for the transportation and
    power sectors. Cumulative deployment is tracked period-by-period,
    used to update technology capital/non-energy costs according to a
    two-factor (learning + fixed-cost) learning curve, and written back
    into the running GCAM model. Also includes helper functions for
    post-processing and plotting scenario comparison results.
